  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The relation between bandwidth and the signal frequency is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Bandwidth</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>signal</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>frequency</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameter into equation (1) to calculate the required bandwidth.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mi>Bandwidth</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kHz</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kHz</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>",
